        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴的缀折处开堂聚禄，乘舆而坐。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book029-b000929-p000-fd4efe7af7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "弹弓反的形态，弹弓木形平直而弓弦急促，形势相反，肘位圆润如同满弓射箭，力在靶心，应当从靶心处下穴。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
